me><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKABAYASHI TOSHIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HOMME, TAKUYA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKABAYASHI, TOSHIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An Ag film (12) is formed as a light-reflecting film on one side of an a-C substrate (10) of a scintillator panel (1). The whole surface of the Ag film (12) is covered with an SiN film (14) for protecting the Ag film (12). A scintillator (16) having a columnar structure for converting the incident radiation to visible light is provided on the SiN film (14). The scintillator (16) and the substrate (10) are covered with a polyparaxylene film (18).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un film d'argent (12) formé, en tant que film réfléchissant la lumière, sur un côté d'un substrat a-C (10) d'un panneau scintillateur (1). La surface entière du film (12) est recouverte d'un film de SiN (14) destiné à protéger le film d'argent (12). Un scintillateur (16) possédant une structure de type colonne, et destiné à convertir le rayonnement incident en lumière visible, est placé sur le film de SiN (14), le scintillateur (16) et le substrat (10) étant recouverts d'un film de polyparaxylène (18).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement 